| Rated voltage | 0.6/1 kV | Class per the cable standard, not a test level for the accessory alone. |
| Conductor range (typical) | 10 to 400 mm2 | Confirm against the accessory size table, not against the lug bore. |
| Cable insulation basis | XLPE 90 C continuous, PVC 70 C continuous | Accessory wall thickness follows the cable temperature class. |
